    <briefdescription>
<para>An intrusive list with ownership and callbacks specified/controlled by <ref refid="structllvm_1_1ilist__traits" kindref="compound">ilist_traits</ref>, only with API safe for polymorphic types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput>Options</computeroutput> parameters are the same as those for <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1simple__ilist" kindref="compound">simple_ilist</ref></emphasis>. See there for a description of what&apos;s available. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
